summary:
#NeurIPS2019 workshop decisions just went out!
Want to hear how decisions were made and see a preliminary list of accepted workshops?
@MarzyehGhassemi, @shakir_za, Bob Williamson, and I wrote a blog post all about the selection process!

The first of 8 #NeurIPS2021 keynotes starts soon!
@LuisvonAhn will speak about "How Duolingo Uses AI to Assess, Engage and Teach Better"
Join us at 15:00 GMT (10am EST).

The 3rd #NeurIPS2021 keynote starts soon!
@lugosi_gabor will give the Breiman Lecture "Do We Know How to Estimate the Mean?" at
at 07:00 GMT.

We want to note that this process augments but does not replace the standard NeurIPS invitation letter. Please see for more details, and for answers to commonly asked questions.
